# pip-audit baseline: advisories reviewed and accepted (or scheduled) as of 2026-11-19.
# CI runs pip-audit with --ignore-vuln for each ID below and FAILS on any advisory not
# listed, so a new vulnerability in a dependency breaks the build.
# Remove an entry when the package is upgraded past the fix (CI will pass without it).
# Format: <advisory-id>  # <package> <version>: <reason>

# --- ecdsa: no fixed release; transitive (python-jose). With the [cryptography] extra, signing uses cryptography, not ecdsa
PYSEC-2026-1325  # ecdsa 0.19.2 (GHSA-wj6h-64fc-37mp,CVE-2024-23342)

